    "turn_idx": 27,
    "turn_text": "Because so many people in this freshman class of Democrats are coming from non-political backgrounds, one of the things that seems different about your class than about how I would think about Congress in the past is that it seems like many of you didn't always aspire to be politicians in the way that we think of so many people in elected office as having spent years planning and plotting for these kinds of campaigns. That wasn't the dream. Would you say that that's accurate when it comes to you?",
