    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/2/82704.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 36,
    "turn_text": "Well, it was a fascinating race. And of course, the point of that episode was that your campaign sort of seemed to embody a kind of larger democratic strategy for winning seats in the House and taking back the majority. And I want to talk about that. But can you start by explaining to a listeners who may not know what led you to run for the House this year?",
