      },
      {
        "text": "Ideological alignment matters more than party unity when considering policy agendas.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The addressee will recognize the distinction between moderate and progressive Democrats without needing further clarification.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Conflict between factions is both possible and meaningful in shaping legislative outcomes.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views the current political landscape as characterized by internal party dynamics rather than external threats.",
