        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Skipping conversations with those who disagree undermines opportunities for genuine consensus.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Idealism is necessary when entering public service.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "In my district, people across the political spectrum can find common ground through conversation.",
