    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/2/82704.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 62,
    "turn_text": "An essential question for you and for everybody else is what this new Democratic House majority will stand for. What kind of Democratic majority will it be? Is there a sense for you that the party needs to be something else than it is right now and has been for the past few years?",
