        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The effectiveness of advocacy depends on aligning messaging with varied stakeholder interests.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Public understanding of environmental issues suffers when conversations are truncated or simplified.",
