      },
      {
        "text": "Continued engagement with voters builds trust and legitimacy in political leadership.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Public perception of effort matters more than immediate policy outcomes.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Political leaders have both the responsibility and capacity to respond meaningfully to voter input.",
        "confidence": 0.88
